      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Agreed. I imagine it'd work similar to per-user muting, avatar displaying, etc.\nExtra points if it works regardless of what your global setting is (So that 'Everyone' would work like a blacklist, 'Off' would work like a whitelist, etc)",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
