      "mergeID": "62245ad517b26374d7387496",
      "mergedPostDetails": "We can permission to other users to grab & touch my phys bones, but grab & touch permissions are in same option.\nSometimes, I want someone can touch&grab my physbones & contact, but sometimes I want someone just can only touch my physbones.\nSo I think seperate this options to two options will better.\nGrab is good, but sometimes that makes harrasment.(Someone grab skirt to up or making hair to weird but I can't see because there's no mirror)",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1181] grab option in quick menu",
