      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "You could potentially have the per-user perms work similarly to how the avatar safety settings work for individual users in which it bypasses the global settings.\n🤝 = Allow perms\n❌ = Deny perms\n🛡️ = Determine based on global permission settings",
