      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'll be a lot more frank than most people here, even among my friends I have those I trust to interact with me and those I very much do not.  Usually in the same instance.  I should not have to be in a private world, one on one, in order to be able to use this functionality at all.  This is true for most people I know as well, nearly anyone you talk to will tell you that they have friends they're close with and friends they are not and they shouldn't have to be stuck with an all or nothing option.  This is especially important among users like myself who have a strong phantom sense, as it's very necessary to avoid people doing things that make us severely uncomfortable but would still like to be able to enjoy interactions with close friends.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
